Fix a ``RecursionError`` when building a module from a live object that holds a
container containing itself, such as the ``globals()`` dict that
``scipy.special`` keeps in a module attribute: pylint crashed on
``from scipy.special import erf`` with ``--extension-pkg-allow-list=scipy``.
The inner reference to the container is now represented by an ``EmptyNode``.

Closes pylint-dev/pylint#10459
Refs #2974
